// c25-gemma3 trailing device TU: the BM == 128 (head_dim 128/64) instantiation of
// flash_attention_half plus the transposed-panel online softmax it needs, split out of
// flash_attention.scpp so that TU keeps the delivered code layout (the D256/D512
// instantiations are the only ones left there).  Body copied VERBATIM from the B5
// candidate (flash_attention.scpp d5606ec1); the six prelude helpers are `static`
// (linkage only) so the two TUs do not collide at LTO link time.
